  // 屠つ — the app's name, as one piece of artwork.
  //
  // The same trace `Mark.svelte` crops its 屠 from, so the two can never drift apart: one
  // drawing, two boxes. See that file for how the outlines were made and how closely they
  // follow the original.
  //
  // **1:2.24, and that is why this is its own component.** A lockup this tall cannot go in the
  // rail or in a 32px icon without shrinking to a smudge, so it lives where there is height to
  // give it and the square mark covers everything else.
  //
  // `--wordmark-size` is a *height*; the width follows from the artwork. Sized that way because
  // every place this goes is a row of text it has to sit level with.

  let { size = "3rem" }: { size?: string } = $props();
</script>

